                "message": "Search the writing projects for Projectile projects\n\nThe :init value of projectile-project-search-path was overridden by the\n:custom one, so ~/Documents/writing was never searched. Set it once, in\n:custom, and add sp-writing-projects to it (depth 1).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WWLNiCtkuUzuiths11Hu1j",
                "tree": {
